      <JapaneseText>罪を背負う男児は、轟斧系を身に纏い
罪を背負う女児は、法術系を身に纏うべし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The boy who bears sin must don the garb
of the Roaring Axe; the girl who bears sin
must don the garb of the Clerical Artes.</EnglishText>
